essment explicitly flags four MISSING inputs (invocation mechanism, async pattern, latency budget, config storage) that must be resolved before implementation. This is characteristic of unbounded-design: the problem space is bounded (weak supervision on worker loops) but the solution space is open and requires framing.\\n\\n**Analysis Method**: design-framing required \u2014 the item needs architectural decisions documented before it can move to execution.\\n\\n**Scenario Target**: Worker agents currently loop on repeated failures or plateau without external oversight, risking wasted turns and API cost \u2192 advisor agent provides execution-time weak supervision, emitting PLAN/CORRECTION/STOP signals that the worker can read and act on (or log disagreement), reducing cost of stuck loops and providing a structured escalation path to human intervention.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n<div><sub>2026-05-09T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nNew files:\\n- plugins/development-harness/agents/advisor.md\\n- plugins/development-harness/hooks/advisor-trigger.cjs\\n\\nModified files:\\n- plugins/development-harness/hooks/hooks.json (add PostToolUse entry for advisor-trigger.cjs)\\n- plugins/development-harness/.claude-plugin/plugin.json (if agent registry is maintained there)\\n\\nContext reference files (read-only):\\n- plugins/development-harness/hooks/block-context-direct-writes.cjs\\n- plugins/development-harness/hooks/stop-kage-bunshin-idle-check.cjs\\n- plugins/development-harness/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/task_status_hook.py\\n</div>\\n\\n<div><sub>2026-05-09T08:31:54Z</sub>\\n\\nNew files:\\n- plugins/development-harness/agents/advisor.md\\n- plugins/development-harness/hooks/advisor-trigger.cjs\\n\\nModified files:\\n- plugins/development-harness/hooks/hooks.json (add PostToolUse entry for advisor-trigger.cjs)\\n- plugins/development-harness/.claude-plugin/plugin.json (if agent registry is maintained there)\\n\\nContext reference files (read-only):\\n- plugins/developmen